# Arktwend from New Game: the harness clicks New and answers TESGameSelect's
# prompt with Arktwend (button 5), and the game's own CharGen script places
# the player in the monastery of Melee. Brother Ventin and Paul greet the
# player in the hall, High Bishop Derminus leads the way to the old statue,
# whose menus are the chargen, and gives back the ring the player was found with.
# PositionCell stands in for the walks; ref FormIDs carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --new-game 5 --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case chargen_start
until 900 GetPCCell "Melee, Monastery" == 1
end

# Brother Ventin stops the player in the hallway.
case chargen_ventin
run
player->PositionCell -2646 1950 745 180 "Melee, Monastery"
wait 120
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_I_Kloster == 1
end

# Paul asks the player to the Fur Seal Tavern tonight.
case chargen_paul
run
player->PositionCell -3286 1950 740 180 "Melee, Monastery"
wait 120
choose 10
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_I_Kloster == 2
end

# Into the church, where Derminus greets the player at Mass and walks to the
# statue.
case chargen_derminus
activate 05657AD8
until 600 GetPCCell "Melee, Monastery Church" == 1
run
player->PositionCell 4283 5100 416 0 "Melee, Monastery Church"
wait 120
bye
until 900 "ANFBischofDerminus"->GetDistance "MarkerANFCharGen01" <= 300
end

# At the statue Derminus tells the player of the ring; the statue opens the
# race, class, sign and review menus, then gives up the ring.
case chargen_statue
run
player->PositionCell 4320 3100 418 0 "Melee, Monastery Church"
wait 120
bye
activate MeleeKlosterCharGenStatue
close RaceSex Menu
pick Warrior
pick The Warrior
until 600 CharGenState == -1
take RingDesKaisers
run
player->Equip RingDesKaisers
until 120 Anfangvar == 1
end

# Derminus says farewell.
case chargen_farewell
talk ANFBischofDerminus
bye
end
